        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"132a67ce-b5c4-467c-996a-179c2ce09698\",\"review_text\":\"Hate this application 😡👎\"},{\"review_id\":\"22e49118-28af-4b2f-aa32-2e93b3ee00b7\",\"review_text\":\"Better than best App ever.All music needs satisfied.\"},{\"review_id\":\"1725390f-b3d5-45f7-ab24-cdc40b3fd03d\",\"review_text\":\"Cool.\"},{\"review_id\":\"51e97cad-d6e4-40cb-b8a8-a066f1d653e1\",\"review_text\":\"I hate this\"},{\"review_id\":\"63cb35b6-b643-4efb-9385-c5293924444c\",\"review_text\":\"Edit: Since they brought back car mode I've raised my rating to 4 stars but there's still some weird bugs like being unable to access my playlists but music still plays and everything on the home page is fine. Old: So, let me get this straight, you removed the perfectly fine car mode - which despite the name actually had plenty of uses outside of a car - and replaced it with a mode that can only be used with the \\\"car thing\\\" - which is currently only available in the USA and costs a cool $80???\"},{\"review_id\":\"0ab0d890-5d22-4cbf-9069-608d76338001\",\"review_text\":\"please fix the jam or bring back how it was before, it has never worked for me or my friends\"},{\"review_id\":\"32d0a502-75a8-4ac5-a525-298acfb653a2\",\"review_text\":\"Very bad app experience so mu ads\"},{\"review_id\":\"9dff372f-10df-446a-94d9-3501fcaa5080\",\"review_text\":\"Seems frequently anymore nothing wants to play i get no sound from spotify but all my other apps work just fine that I dont pay a monthly subcription to! I even tried before and after the update nothing!\"},{\"review_id\":\"20de1c4b-2ea3-4334-b571-8393ecb3196d\",\"review_text\":\"i use spotify daily, and lately its been causing issues. it isnt letting me remove songs from playlists anymore. its really annoying.\"},{\"review_id\":\"d6d4c6db-4fb9-4c7c-b86f-e0b2edde4175\",\"review_text\":\"Worst update ever.\"}]}"
